This was a group project that I did with one other person in C#. I made the controls work so that it is
using ConsoleKey so that it is easier to interact with the game as you don't have to push the button and
then push enter. I also made the inventory, including making it so that you can get random or customize
the equipment with what was in the game, I made the hp, the combat system and the systems to check if the
player died or inputted the wrong key.
